1
00:00:05,278 --> 00:00:07,728
(Sheldon:)Do we really have to go
to Mrs. Wolowitz's house?

2
00:00:08,281 --> 00:00:09,451
(Amy:)We do.

3
00:00:09,616 --> 00:00:12,286
(Amy:)And I expect you
to be on your best behavior.

4
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,692
(Sheldon:)Now I know how the
African slaves felt.

5
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:18,700
(Sheldon:)Being dragged from their homes

6
00:00:18,859 --> 00:00:22,069
to labor under the
yoke of the white man.

7
00:00:22,229 --> 00:00:25,229
(Amy:)Are you honestly comparing
Thanksgiving dinner

8
00:00:25,399 --> 00:00:28,039
(Amy:)at Wolowitz's mom's with
one of the greatest tragedies

9
00:00:28,201 --> 00:00:29,911
(Amy:)in the history of mankind?

10
00:00:30,337 --> 00:00:31,837
(Penny:)Yes.

11
00:00:33,006 --> 00:00:34,886
(Penny:)Sheldon, you can have
a nice Thanksgiving anywhere.

12
00:00:35,042 --> 00:00:36,352
(Penny:)I spent one in Vegas.

13
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,350
(Leonard:)You did?

14
00:00:37,511 --> 00:00:39,351
(Penny:)Yeah, back when I was dating Zack.

15
00:00:39,513 --> 00:00:40,993
(Penny:)It was actually more fun
than I thought.

16
00:00:41,148 --> 00:00:43,528
(Penny:)We gambled, we went to one
of those cheesy wedding chapels,

17
00:00:43,684 --> 00:00:45,164
(Penny:)we had a really good
turkey dinner.

18
00:00:45,318 --> 00:00:47,818
(Penny:)Which was surprising,
since we were at a strip club.

19
00:00:49,856 --> 00:00:51,236
(Leonard:)Wait, you went to a chapel?

20
00:00:51,391 --> 00:00:52,601
(Sheldon:)-Yeah.
-Why?

21
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:55,709
(Penny:)We had one of those
silly fake weddings.

22
00:00:59,433 --> 00:01:00,533
(Leonard:)Penny...

23
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,740
(Leonard:)You know those are real, right?

